{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"e33d83e0baf8ab305eb7744e44e4025489f7b88e87e1b1fb5ff9da3b88264ed4","ja":"レッツダンシング！","zh":"一起跳舞吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ab2ce6adb59fe22ef610df527035b66c04133b63dee29c664161b959ecbae51d","ja":"4人はさっそく、場所を移動して……","zh":"4人马上移动到其他地方……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"82442ff5a401b0806b48355a3e664d1f22e381abf04e7df7202e21d0cfc2df85","ja":"準備オッケーだね！　それじゃあ、\nサンバ動画の撮影……スタートだヨ！","zh":"准备好了吧！那么，桑巴视频的拍摄……开始咯！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9e22fa70c6b86e419e10cf7c7f6c6975291f1264a4f956d24360f38e0d883903","ja":"ピーピーピーピピ、ピピッピピーピー♪","zh":"哔——哔——哔——哔哔，哔哔哔哔——哔——♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e55e5f7718476d4f9863edebccdc3b45f15df10df66b162e7826e123625a94e3","ja":"ミズキ！　リズミカルでナイスなホイッスルだネ！\n聞いてるだけで、楽しくなっちゃうヨ！","zh":"瑞希！这口哨吹得节奏感十足，真不错！\n光是听着就让人开心起来了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"54b66f3af87a3816dfb6311c87a1348ad52612ddcda18aad1ee23913ca6b45d2","ja":"わっほーい！\nなんだか、体が勝手に動き出しちゃうね！","zh":"哇哦——！\n不知怎么的，身体自己就动起来了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"fbbdaaa49d7fb5a93c0b1393a11d085620654d036825f8492b5098bea5db9cea","ja":"は、はい！　で、でも、私のダンスがたくさんの人に\n配信されるって考えると……ド、ドキドキします～。","zh":"是、是的！可、可是，一想到我的舞蹈会被很多人看到……就、就好紧张～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"64128dbc47f795de6fe20a5a476a2092a105ef1dde82270f0297aeb47af51c27","ja":"難しいことは考えなくて、大丈夫だヨ！\nリズムに身を任せて！","zh":"不用想太复杂，没关系哟！\n跟着节奏走吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"9ff10bc6dac757eee05b33f880b573c0db63f860bebadd924e980295c0693857","ja":"サンバに大事なことは1つだけ！\n最高の笑顔だヨ～！　ほらほら、スマ～イル♪","zh":"桑巴最重要的只有1件事！\n那就是最棒的笑容哦～！来嘛来嘛，微～笑♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"3bb4dbda140238834c3eb5a570ff2f019f1c339c37a3aa6cd65601d6fbde8a4c","ja":"なるほど。ではさっそく……にっこり。\n……ピーピピッ。","zh":"原来如此。那么马上开始……微笑。\n……哔哔哔。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"4c24168d6301d0231e421df433f9f5a431585be4280ef6e29f79501e36d302b3","ja":"たしかに、笑顔だと、\nサンバの楽しさがたくさん伝わるね！","zh":"确实，露出笑容的话，\n就能传达出很多桑巴的快乐呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"80b92fae18b5012033604ceec2a9d78577c78c38f6f9ea48b44b313a575a5d6b","ja":"……ふ、ふふっ。そ、そうですね。\nわ、私も、楽しくなってきました……♪","zh":"……呵、呵呵。是、是啊。\n我、我也开始觉得开心起来了……♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"24f296a896fa41a0baea39419639d646722b89250799ac8a0da2d95e2c27bc70","ja":"うんうん！　みんな、とってもいい笑顔だネ！\n配信を見てるキミも、レッツダンシングだヨ♪","zh":"嗯嗯！大家的笑容都特别棒呢！\n正在看直播的你，也一起来跳舞吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"b9f279f6467dd6c36ecc6234bd2f16d57c164f39ba4704cb0d854a9e6bdb2571","ja":"みんなはノリノリでサンバを踊って……","zh":"大家兴致勃勃地跳着桑巴……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"a235e8accea9bcc022a8079a17f5f5471ee375c170e8b121a3f71871a85b65be","ja":"みんな、お疲れさま！\nおかげで、とっても素敵な動画が撮れたヨ～♪","zh":"大家辛苦啦！\n多亏了大家，拍到了非常棒的视频哟～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"1870268f014e8770f09c8fcae639706cce10404cde2f00161a99e5fa3b0c0094","ja":"ピーピピピッ……もう終わりですか。もっとホイッスル\nを吹いていたかったです。……名残惜しいぞ。","zh":"哔哔哔……已经结束了吗。还想再多吹一会儿\n哨子。……真舍不得啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[58].text","source_sha256":"b900636bf94ff04dec2a3637ba98c47c8cfb2eb319f281cea65d3cfe81c56b6f","ja":"それじゃあ早速、\n動画がどんな感じに撮れてるのか、見てみようよ！","zh":"那么我们赶紧看看视频拍得怎么样吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[59].text","source_sha256":"8c44aa72922e28fe43884ed631d3074eb7416b86650f0282b690c8e81a34341b","ja":"うう……き、急にまた、緊張してきました……。\nう、うまく、踊れてたかな……。","zh":"呜呜……突、突然又紧张起来了……。\n不、不知道刚才跳得好不好……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[60].text","source_sha256":"35133f709996013f87a57c00a3dbe9964ebe9ddf371e36870b8bbfb000ce4673","ja":"大丈夫だよ！　可憐ちゃん、とってもかわいい笑顔で\n楽しそうに踊ってたから！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:42+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1817.unity3d","item_key":"commands[68].text","source_sha256":"99426a78a682b166e751682410544040bfa928357d321c02667f05bc38b12171","ja":"それじゃあ、再生するネ！　スイッチオン♪","zh":"那么，要播放了哦！打开开关♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
